@startuml Gaelic_Games_With_Database

title Gaelic Games Application - Activity Diagram with Data Flow

' Styling
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor LightYellow
skinparam ActivityBorderColor Black
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor LightBlue
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor Wheat
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor Black

|#lightblue|Participant|
start

:Login;

if (Code Type?) then (Teacher)

  |#lightgreen|Teacher|

  :Teacher Dashboard;

  note right
    • View live sessions
    • Export CSV/JSON
  end note

  stop

else (Participant)

  |#lightblue|Participant|

  :Welcome;

  :Pre-Games Tutorial;

  :Game 1 Tutorial;

  :Game 1 {≤4 min};

  :Interval 1;

  :Game 2 Tutorial;

  :Game 2;

  :Interval 2;

  :Game 3 Tutorial;

  :Game 3 {≤3 min};

  :Results;

  stop

endif

|#lightyellow|System|

' Database as floating component
partition "**Data Storage**" {
  (**Database**)
  database Database
  note right of Database
    **Firestore**
    • Session data
    • Event logs
    • Scores
  end note
}

' Data flow annotations
note bottom
  **Data Flow:**
  1. Games log data → Database
  2. Database provides data → Teacher Dashboard
end note

@enduml
